    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρ-εῖον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρήϊον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bucket</i> or
				<i>pitcher,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dem.Phal.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				5J.
			</span></i>, Ergias ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.360f
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἀργύρειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					4.306.14
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Panamara</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. χαλκοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					387 ii 15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>reservoir,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
