				Id.
				1.2.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				6.181
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sebaste</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sardis</u>
				7(1)
			</span></i> No. <i><span class="en">
				17.13
			</span></i>.</div>
